      "description": "Reentrancy in ReentrantERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#58-67):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- (nestedSuccess,None) = target.call(abi.encodeCall(IRaffle.buyEntries,(address(this),uint128(1)))) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#61)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- attackEnabled = false (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#64)\n\tReentrantERC20.attackEnabled (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#14) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- ReentrantERC20.arm(address) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#38-42)\n\t- ReentrantERC20.attackEnabled (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#14)\n\t- ReentrantERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#58-67)\n\t- attacking = false (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#63)\n\tReentrantERC20.attacking (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#17) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- ReentrantERC20.transfer(address,uint256) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#69-79)\n\t- ReentrantERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (src/mocks/ReentrantERC20.sol#58-67)\n",
